        para("The forced-choice mechanic is the most important design decision in the product. When a user must choose between 5 options and can only keep 2\u20133, the signal quality is dramatically higher than a simple thumbs up/down. \"I chose this site over that one\" tells the system far more about preference than \"I liked this site.\" This is the same principle that makes tournament-style ranking more informative than individual ratings."),

